## SECTION 1 — HEADER BANNER
<div class="banner">
    <h1>Lesson Planner – Theme # Shapes Around Us – Lesson # 3</h1>
    <p>Complete this planner five times per theme, once per lesson (Lesson 1 through Lesson 5).</p>
